Z||000015||Standard||02-19-2001||09:20 AM||||There's a pretty high number of 86 v6 SE's, because that was the only choice for a V6 Fiero in 86 until the GT came out mid-year.  87 V6 SE's are relativly rare.<P>------------------<BR>Everybody wants a normal life and a cool car.. <B>Most people settle for the car</B><P>I'm not dumb.  I just have a command of thoroughly useless information<BR>        <BR>AOL: LastMinuteBastrd<BR>AIM: SavedByJebus    -- you'll understand if you watch The Simpsons :D||||reg||1
