Z||000019||Kelvin Vivian||02-20-2001||08:02 PM||||Here are the 84 and 85 Fiero model production numbers:<P>84 Indy Pace Car: 2,000<BR>84 Base Coupe: 7,099<BR>84 Sport Coupe: 62,070<BR>84 SE: 65,671<BR>Total 84 Production: 136,843<P>85 Base Coupe: 5,280<BR>85 Sport Coupe: 23,823<BR>85 SE 4-cyl: 12,901<BR>85 SE V6: 11,833<BR>85 GT: 22,534<BR>Total 85 Production: 76,371<P>Kelvin <BR>87 SE 4-cyl<BR>88 GT T-top||||reg||1
Z||000020||87GT||02-20-2001||08:33 PM||||According to a production list I have of all the fiero models and years, the 87 SE 4 or 6 bangers are both rare.  This list shows there being less of those made than 88 Formulas or 88GTs.  So they are pretty rare. Im looking at my list now and it shows 3,875 87SE Fieros produced.  Ive even noticed that whenever I see a SE for sale, its rarely a 87 model year.  Just thought I would let some of you know of this.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
